{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l001", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 1, "raw": "Ошол улуу дейт кыргыздан,", "text": "Ошол улуу дейт кыргыздан,", "en": "That great one, they say, was a Kyrgyz,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": null, "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l002", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 2, "raw": "Ачу айт чапса ураба,", "text": "Ачу айт чапса ураба,", "en": "When anger spoke, do not strike and break,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The cursive middle words are provisional; possibly a formula concerning striking in anger.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l003", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 3, "raw": "Туулду дейт кыргыздан,", "text": "Туулду дейт кыргыздан,", "en": "He was born, they say, among the Kyrgyz,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": null, "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l004", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 4, "raw": "Топтой сайса бору алган,", "text": "Топтой сайса бору алган,", "en": "When he thrust like a ball, he took the prize,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final noun is difficult cursive and is provisionally read as бору.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l005", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 5, "raw": "Түнкүсү бузуп жол салган,", "text": "Түнкүсү бузуп жол салган,", "en": "By night he broke through and made a road,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": null, "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l006", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 6, "raw": "Турбай журтка кол салган,", "text": "Турбай журтка кол салган,", "en": "Without delay he attacked the people,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": null, "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l007", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 7, "raw": "Бир түшүнүк дейт кыргыздан.", "text": "Бир түшүнүк дейт кыргыздан.", "en": "One of understanding, they say, from the Kyrgyz.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The noun after Бир is a difficult cursive reading, provisionally түшүнүк.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l008", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 8, "raw": "Бет алып балбан барыптыр,", "text": "Бет алып балбан барыптыр,", "en": "The champion went straight against him,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": null, "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l009", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 9, "raw": "Беттешкенден далай жан,", "text": "Беттешкенден далай жан,", "en": "Of the many souls who faced him,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": null, "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l010", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 10, "raw": "Кайрылгыс жайын көрүптүр.", "text": "Кайрылгыс жайын көрүптүр.", "en": "They saw a place from which none returned.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The first word is provisionally read Кайрылгыс; the clause is semantically clear but cursive is compressed.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l011", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 11, "raw": "Качанга калбай канча жан,", "text": "Качанга калбай канча жан,", "en": "Before long, so many souls,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The opening temporal phrase is provisional.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l012", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 12, "raw": "Каза болуп олтур.", "text": "Каза болуп олтур.", "en": "Sat there having perished.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": null, "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l013", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 13, "raw": "Караса мушкул ушундай.", "text": "Караса мушкул ушундай.", "en": "When one looks, such was the calamity.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": null, "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l014", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 14, "raw": "Ошентип турган кыргыздан", "text": "Ошентип турган кыргыздан", "en": "Thus, among the Kyrgyz who stood there,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The middle verb is provisionally турган.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l015", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 15, "raw": "Чамасы чарчап билгиле,", "text": "Чамасы чарчап билгиле,", "en": "Know that his strength had wearied,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The first two words are a provisional reading of tight cursive.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l016", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 16, "raw": "Чаркын чаптап жүргүздү,", "text": "Чаркын чаптап жүргүздү,", "en": "He drove them on, striking at their ranks,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Both Чаркын and the final verb are provisional manuscript readings.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l017", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 17, "raw": "Саркалуунун айлына,", "text": "Саркалуунун айлына,", "en": "Toward Sarkaluu’s settlement,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The place/name Саркалуу is uncertain.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l018", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 18, "raw": "Чабын чаптап келгиле,", "text": "Чабын чаптап келгиле,", "en": "Come on, striking through the raid,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The first phrase is difficult cursive and provisionally transcribed.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l019", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 19, "raw": "Бузулуп Бээжин улуу журт,", "text": "Бузулуп Бээжин улуу журт,", "en": "Great Beijing, the mighty people, fell into disorder,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Word division around Бээжин and улуу is clear enough for a provisional reading.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l020", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 20, "raw": "Койчунун көрсөң тонун көр,", "text": "Койчунун көрсөң тонун көр,", "en": "If you see the shepherd, look at his coat,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Highly uncertain cursive line; wording is a best-effort provisional reading.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l021", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 21, "raw": "Баатырлары башкача,", "text": "Баатырлары башкача,", "en": "Its warriors were exceptional,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": null, "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l022", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 22, "raw": "Бардык эр оңолгон,", "text": "Бардык эр оңолгон,", "en": "Every man had recovered,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The first word may be бардык; final verb is read оңолгон.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l023", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 23, "raw": "Баш билбеген жаманды,", "text": "Баш билбеген жаманды,", "en": "The unruly villain who acknowledged no leader,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": null, "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l024", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 24, "raw": "Кайра келип жайына,", "text": "Кайра келип жайына,", "en": "Returned again to his place,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": null, "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l025", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 25, "raw": "Аттанып эли жоолошкон,", "text": "Аттанып эли жоолошкон,", "en": "His people mounted up and went to war,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "First verb is likely Аттанып; the manuscript hand compresses the double consonant.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l026", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 26, "raw": "Бээжиликтер Чын Теңир,", "text": "Бээжиликтер Чын Теңир,", "en": "The people of Beijing—True Heaven,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The ethnonym and name/title Чын Теңир are provisional.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l027", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 27, "raw": "Абийри болот, заары күч,", "text": "Абийри болот, заары күч,", "en": "He has honor, and his venom is strong,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The manuscript appears to read Абийри болот, заары күч; punctuation supplied.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l028", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 28, "raw": "Ал аскер тоодой калың бар.", "text": "Ал аскер тоодой калың бар.", "en": "That army is dense as a mountain.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The noun аскер is a slightly uncertain cursive reading.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l029", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 29, "raw": "Оолукмасы кармаса,", "text": "Оолукмасы кармаса,", "en": "When his frenzy seizes him,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": null, "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l030", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 30, "raw": "Он сегиз миң ааламды", "text": "Он сегиз миң ааламды", "en": "The eighteen thousand worlds,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": null, "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l031", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 31, "raw": "Ойрон кылчу алы бар.", "text": "Ойрон кылчу алы бар.", "en": "He has the might to lay waste.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": null, "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l032", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 32, "raw": "Журтка болот короочун,", "text": "Журтка болот короочун,", "en": "He becomes a scourge upon the people,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Final word is difficult and provisionally read короочун; translation follows the hostile context.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l033", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 33, "raw": "Каардуу жинин кармаса,", "text": "Каардуу жинин кармаса,", "en": "When his furious demon seizes him,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": null, "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l034", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 34, "raw": "Он сегиз миң ааламды", "text": "Он сегиз миң ааламды", "en": "The eighteen thousand worlds,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": null, "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l035", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 35, "raw": "Ажыдаардай оп тартып,", "text": "Ажыдаардай оп тартып,", "en": "Drawing breath like a dragon,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": null, "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf057:l036", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 57, "folio": 440, "line_in_page": 36, "raw": "Айбан дүйнө жоолошуп.", "text": "Айбан дүйнө жоолошуп.", "en": "The beastly world rises in enmity.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final manuscript line is faint and provisionally read Айбан дүйнө жоолошуп.", "bbox": null}
